eoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1782063091823331001,"creation_channel":"unknown","deps":[{"link_uuid":"f8958f99-26c3-431a-9dcd-e92cc82082ed","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"5fd2-a7c2-0aec-48fa"}],"description":"## Context\nThe review gates expose real configuration — risk posture, chunking, budget caps, per-criterion advisory-vs-\nblocking, and a global enable/disable kill-switch. A project needs a coherent way to read, set, and validate\nthat config rather than hand-editing scattered keys. (Spun out of `5fd2` as a separate epic; was follow-on F5.)\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] A validated config schema covering risk posture, chunking, budget caps, per-criterion blocking, the global enable/disable, and the ADVISORY SURFACING CAP (top-N advisory findings; default 10; NEVER applies to blocking findings).\n- [ ] A CLI/MCP surface to read/set/validate the config with shipped defaults.\n- [ ] Invalid config is a located error, not a silent no-op.\n- [ ] A single, validated configuration surface for the review gates with sensible shipped defaults.\n- [ ] A tool/UX to view and set it (per-criterion posture, chunking, budgets, the enable/disable switch) with","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","managed_refs":[["relates_to","5fd2-a7c2-0aec-48fa"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"b6289878-42ac-48c9-86c6-f3498af21ef4","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":1,"reverts":[],"status":"idea","tags":[],"ticket_id":"55de-25ab-ca20-4c79","ticket_type":"epic","title":"Review-gate project configuration tool + UX (risk posture, chunking, budgets, per-criterion blocking, enable/disable)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["632048c6-9139-460d